{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/OccursCheck.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.occursCheck\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">occursCheck</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if `mvarId` does **not** occur in `e`, directly or indirectly.\nThis function considers assignments and delayed assignments.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/OccursCheck.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.occursCheck","kind":"def","line":76,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.occursCheck","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/OccursCheck.lean#L76-L84"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.OccursCheck"}